+# DUNGEON AUTOFILL (local patch)
+#
+# Keeps every real player's dungeon-finder queue fed with role/level-appropriate random bots, so a
+# queued dungeon ALWAYS fills instead of waiting on the vanilla matchmaker to happen to have the
+# right bots queued. A world-thread tick queues free bots (a tank, a healer, then DPS) for the
+# player's selected dungeons using the same mechanism bots use to queue themselves; the core LFG
+# matcher then forms the group. Self-healing - if a tick doesn't form the group it tops the queue
